WEBVTT

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:11.250
Dreadful...

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:12.880
What is that?

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.330
Japanese?

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:17.790
You mean that country in Asia?
Where they do that "harakiri"?

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:28.920
I'm pleased to meet you, Lord Horikawa.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:31.580
Welcome to the Kingdom of Albion.

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:36.380
I am greatly honored that you would
welcome us yourself, Princess.

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:39.380
It basically means our "princess of air"

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:42.790
is all they're willing to send
for an Eastern island nation.

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:45.420
They've likely considered the risks involved.

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:50.290
I doubt the Crown is unaware
of the assassination attempts.

00:00:52.210 --> 00:00:55.290
The assassins' ringleader is Todo Jubei.

00:00:55.670 --> 00:00:58.130
Apparently he's single-handedly cut down 100 men.

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:03.330
These undeveloped countries
and their overblown rumors...

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:07.420
It was in a European military report.

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:12.880
During the Boshin War, he boarded
an ironclad ship and sank it unaided.

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:16.130
But you know, now that
we have the Princess on our side,

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:19.830
I would hate for her to get caught up
in an assassination plot.

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:21.750
That won't be a problem.

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:24.380
That is what our Principal is for.

00:01:34.130 --> 00:01:36.920
I've had the royal car prepared for you.

00:01:37.670 --> 00:01:40.000
It will take us to London. This way, please.

00:01:40.210 --> 00:01:44.170
All this, for us. We are deeply in your debt.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:52.540
We entrust ourselves to your care on our journey.

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:55.960
Er, yes...

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:58.710
These Japanese people are peculiar.

00:01:58.710 --> 00:02:02.670
I'm sure they'd love to hear that
from a native of the Black Lizard Planet.

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:46.000
I understand you came here
to revise the treaty, Lord Horikawa?

00:03:49.130 --> 00:03:52.420
The current terms are far too one-sided.

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:56.290
Of course, this is a result of our own ignorance.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:57.710
However...

00:03:57.710 --> 00:04:00.460
Horikawa-sama, this is not the place.

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:01.960
Uh, yes.

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:03.460
Of course.

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:07.210
I see how important this is to you, Lord Horikawa.

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:10.580
I have no authority over it myself,

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:14.380
but I can promise you a meeting with my Grandmother.

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:15.920
Oh!

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:24.920
I am in your debt. Truly, truly in your debt.

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:26.500
Please, you mustn't!

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:28.040
It's nothing...

00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:50.460
Someone's here.

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:53.420
We're on a moving train. No one could...

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:02.210
Who are you?

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:07.540
You Western women have no manners.

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:11.380
When you ask someone's name, you first name yourself.

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:16.210
Are you Todo Jubei?

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:18.580
I didn't expect you to be a woman.

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:21.880
Two handguns.

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:24.790
At your bosom and behind your waist.

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:27.000
And your left shoe...

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:28.920
You have something hidden there.

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:31.210
I hear the faint clinking of metal.

00:05:33.290 --> 00:05:35.580
Jumping onto a train with no backup.

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:37.460
That's a legendary killer for you.

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:43.960
You little-!

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:50.330
Dorothy!

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:08.170
The world is truly vast.

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:12.170
To think I would find such martial skill in the West.

00:06:12.380 --> 00:06:15.920
You impress me, too. So the story
about you killing 100 men was hardly fake.

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:19.540
Stop!

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:23.380
She is not the assassin!

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:25.420
Hold your fire!

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:27.630
She's NOT our enemy?

00:06:28.170 --> 00:06:30.830
Chise-dono, what are you doing here?

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:32.170
You know why I'm here!

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:34.630
To slay Todo Jubei!

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:37.830
That is why

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:41.630
I have come to this distant foreign land.

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:48.170
I couldn't send you back alone.

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:52.290
For the time being, I will allow you
to accompany me as far as London.

00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:54.170
Thank you, My Lord.

00:06:54.420 --> 00:07:00.290
You have my word, I will protect you
and put an end to those rebels.

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:02.250
We agreed to take you with us,

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:03.420
but any fighting will...

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:07.830
I know Todo Jubei better than any of your samurai.

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:09.210
Yes, but...

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:10.920
I'm against it.

00:07:12.210 --> 00:07:14.040
With Princess onboard,

00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:17.330
I cannot allow any dubious characters to ride this train.

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:20.250
You question my intent?

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:22.830
You ARE a stowaway.

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:28.540
Then allow me to prove my trustworthiness.

00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:31.790
Stop it, both of you.

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:34.250
Chise-dono, put your sword away.

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:38.080
Ange.

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:41.540
I want you to be Miss Chise's buddy.

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:42.540
What?

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:44.880
"Buddy," "buddy"...

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:46.460
It means "partner."

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:48.210
Me? Partner to HER?

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:49.670
Princess,

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:51.290
this isn't funny.

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:54.540
If this girl is dangerous,

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:57.710
that's all the more reason to put her
under the watchful eye of someone I can trust.

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:15.420
There's a platoon of 50 railroad security guards
riding in Car 5 and the caboose.

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:19.170
It will take more than a flimsy attack to kill Lord Horikawa.

00:08:20.130 --> 00:08:23.710
Jubei's attacks are not flimsy.

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:26.040
Have you fought him?

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:27.630
Many times.

00:08:27.880 --> 00:08:29.170
Why did you fight him?

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:30.880
Was it a matter of principle?

00:08:31.830 --> 00:08:34.330
Or was it some matter between the masters you serve?

00:08:34.670 --> 00:08:36.330
Is this an interrogation?

00:08:37.210 --> 00:08:40.500
We're buddies. We need to get to know each other.

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:44.500
I hail from the Saga domain. A samurai clan. Age 16.

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:46.330
I like pickles.

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:47.330
And you?

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:52.380
Ange. Age 17.

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:54.540
I come from the Black Lizard Planet.

00:08:56.170 --> 00:08:58.790
I see! That's how you learned those martial arts.

00:09:00.290 --> 00:09:03.210
Princess Kaguya, too, came from the Moon.

00:09:03.460 --> 00:09:04.580
It all makes sense.

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:07.580
You have Selenites in Japan?

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:11.790
Not only people from among the stars.
We live close to the gods, as well.

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:13.330
Close to the gods?

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:15.380
They reside in the mountains, the rivers,

00:09:15.380 --> 00:09:17.130
even in the latrine.

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:18.830
What?

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:30.080
This is the only stop before we get to London.

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:34.040
Which is to say, if he were to attack, he would do it here.

00:09:46.170 --> 00:09:47.080
Don't cry.

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:49.670
I will take the pain away.

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:52.330
Owie, owie,

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:53.500
fly away!

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:55.920
Owie, owie,

00:09:55.920 --> 00:09:57.210
fly away!

00:09:59.250 --> 00:10:00.210
Better?

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:02.130
Uh-huh. I'm all right.

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:11.790
What did you do?

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:15.080
An Eastern magic spell
handed down to me from my father.

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:17.880
He cast it for me many times in the past.

00:10:28.710 --> 00:10:31.920
Why are we helping Todo Jubei?

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:35.750
I have no interest in that eastern island nation.

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:40.960
I only hope he gets that woman
caught up in an assassination plot.

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:45.170
She may be only a figurehead,
but she's fourth in line to the throne.

00:10:45.630 --> 00:10:49.080
We can't be sure someone won't move her ahead.

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:03.290
So he didn't come after us at Maidstone Station.

00:11:03.460 --> 00:11:08.250
Even the fearsome Jubei is out of his element
in a foreign nation, it seems.

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:12.210
He will appear.

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:15.460
Jubei isn't such a simple opponent.

00:11:15.920 --> 00:11:18.250
Why are you so obsessed with him?

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:20.670
Because Jubei...

00:11:20.670 --> 00:11:22.630
killed my father.

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:28.380
Two years ago, time stopped for me completely.

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:34.040
And until I strike Jubei down,
my tears refuse to be shed.

00:11:49.920 --> 00:11:52.040
And what do you think you're doing?

00:11:52.880 --> 00:11:55.380
I was watching the janitor, too.

00:11:55.830 --> 00:11:57.670
Are you Todo Jubei?

00:12:09.460 --> 00:12:10.630
An explosion?

00:12:12.880 --> 00:12:13.830
Stay here.

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:15.630
I'll go see what's happening.

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:26.710
What? But how?

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:40.290
The outbound trains should all have
stopped running for security reasons.

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:42.420
Then it must be...

00:12:51.380 --> 00:12:52.790
Todo Jubei!

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:56.880
I see the Duke of Normandy kept his promise.

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:58.130
Fire!

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:11.960
Slow down the engine!

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:14.500
We need to get back to the soldiers!

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:18.790
Can't! If we slow down while we're
still connected, we'll derail!

00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:21.580
He's boarding the train!

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:23.210
Everyone, draw your swords!

00:13:26.710 --> 00:13:27.380
Fire!

00:13:27.380 --> 00:13:28.630
Your Highness, get down!

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:38.250
Dorothy!

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:39.670
I'm sorry.

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:41.290
I messed up.

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:42.630
Where's Princess?

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:45.960
In the state car. Go to her, Ange.

00:13:46.250 --> 00:13:48.330
With your C-ball, you can still catch them.

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:53.500
Take me with you.

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:56.670
That is where we'll find Jubei.

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:04.250
Please.

00:14:09.670 --> 00:14:11.710
I'll take all the help I can get.

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:20.670
Follow my timing.

00:14:21.830 --> 00:14:22.580
Two.

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:24.130
One.

00:14:25.040 --> 00:14:25.920
Zero!

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:45.210
What?!

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:53.290
You would betray us, Chise-dono?!

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:56.080
You are the traitors!

00:14:58.250 --> 00:14:59.170
Why you-!

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:05.830
SHE is here.

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:07.330
Go faster!

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:08.380
Yes, sir!

00:15:11.920 --> 00:15:13.170
Don't fall behind!

00:15:13.170 --> 00:15:15.080
They'll drag us off the rails!

00:15:15.960 --> 00:15:16.920
This is bad.

00:15:16.920 --> 00:15:17.630
What?

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:21.040
The tracks merge up ahead.

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:28.380
If the cars hit each other at this speed,
it will be a catastrophe!

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:32.830
Ange!

00:15:37.210 --> 00:15:38.380
Don't let them board!

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:42.960
They went up top!

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:44.250
Such incredible skill!

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:55.080
I'll let you handle this.

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:56.130
As you wish.

00:16:03.130 --> 00:16:04.330
Jubei-dono!

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:05.830
Oshima?

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:06.830
Forgive me!

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:09.630
No!

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:21.500
Lord Horikawa. I am here for your life.

00:16:21.670 --> 00:16:23.420
Pathetic remnant of the Shogunate!

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:24.710
Protect our lord!

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:29.500
Your Highness, get back!

00:16:35.170 --> 00:16:36.000
Beatrice!

00:16:37.080 --> 00:16:38.920
Some sort of armor?

00:16:46.670 --> 00:16:47.920
JUBEI!

00:16:53.380 --> 00:16:54.500
Princess!

00:16:56.130 --> 00:16:57.040
Wait!

00:16:57.920 --> 00:16:59.250
Ange!

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:00.710
Let's stop these trains!

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:32.960
Princess!

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:34.920
Close the regulator valve!

00:17:35.830 --> 00:17:37.500
Use the red lever!

00:17:38.920 --> 00:17:40.290
Turn the reversing gear to the right!

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:51.380
Next, open the bypass valve!

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:12.130
And brake!

00:18:41.290 --> 00:18:42.420
We did it.

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:58.380
You've grown stronger, Chise.

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:09.040
Chise, you...

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:13.960
Please be at ease, Lord Horikawa.

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:18.790
I have slain the traitor, Todo Jubei.

00:19:40.250 --> 00:19:42.250
Jubei was your father.

00:19:45.130 --> 00:19:49.170
The caring father who taught me the sword was dead.

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:55.920
The man resting here is nothing more
than a traitorous assassin.

00:19:57.290 --> 00:20:00.750
Is this what you wanted?

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:03.880
I have no need for your sympathy.

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:07.880
Rather, I am proud.

00:20:08.380 --> 00:20:11.210
I was able to surpass my father.

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:15.830
Let's go. Dorothy is waiting.

00:20:23.460 --> 00:20:24.580
Chise...

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:28.580
Thank you for keeping Princess safe.

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:38.630
Owie, owie, fly away.

00:20:39.540 --> 00:20:42.330
Owie, owie, fly away.

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:48.040
How strange.

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:51.920
Your spell isn't working, Father.

00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:57.170
It won't take away the pain in my heart.

00:21:08.670 --> 00:21:12.080
Should you really be drinking alcohol?

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:16.420
Oh, don't worry. My wounds have closed up nicely.

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:17.130
Wanna see?

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:18.750
No, thank you.

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:19.670
Excuse me.

00:21:25.170 --> 00:21:26.130
You're-!

00:21:29.290 --> 00:21:31.670
A new transfer student. Todo Chise.

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:33.330
Transfer student?!

00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:35.170
We're glad to have you, Chise.

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:37.830
This room is our base of operations.

00:21:37.960 --> 00:21:39.250
Isn't it lovely?

00:21:39.250 --> 00:21:40.040
Huh?

00:21:40.040 --> 00:21:41.000
Huh?!

00:21:41.420 --> 00:21:46.630
Our respective employers have struck a deal.
I will be helping with Operation: Changeling.

00:21:46.750 --> 00:21:49.830
I introduced Lord Horikawa to Control.

00:21:50.290 --> 00:21:53.920
I thought he might switch over to the Commonwealth.

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:58.500
When did you s-s-seduce Lord Horikawa?

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:01.500
You nobles use such naughty language.

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:03.960
But wh-what else could I call it?

00:22:08.130 --> 00:22:13.040
Ange. You made it possible for me to fight Jubei.

00:22:13.040 --> 00:22:15.670
Allow me to thank you again.

00:22:16.290 --> 00:22:17.330
Stop.

00:22:18.290 --> 00:22:22.630
If you're going to live in our country,
I'll teach you how we do it in the West.

00:22:24.710 --> 00:22:26.130
It's called a handshake.

00:22:36.540 --> 00:22:40.460
These Western customs aren't so bad.
